*Left out**\n- #4812 (3/10/25 digest) is Vantorre Mobility.\n- #PD-4418 (9/15/25 digest) is \"the account Nadia runs\", with no account named, so I couldn't confirm it's Vantorre.\n- #PD-4402 is Quillfeather Outfitters.\n- 8836 is a trailer number, not a ticket.\n\nThe 7/7/25, 12/1/25 and 5/3/26 digests and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre but give no ticket numbers.\n\nI can only see these three sources, so tickets that live in the support system itself may be missing. Gideon or Support could check there."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
